{"id":"3b176a5adc751091","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-godel-to-lob.md","title":"Gödel Sentence is Löb Sentence of False","display":"prop-godel-to-lob — Gödel Sentence is Löb Sentence of False","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-godel-to-lob","aliases":["92-prop-godel-to-lob"],"display":"prop-godel-to-lob — Gödel Sentence is Löb Sentence of False","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"],"source":"本地可证等价固定点；原书第 VIII–IX 章 pp.102–110 提供 Gödel/Henkin/Löb 与 HBL 背景；本地字符串和数码编码另行指定","source_status":"原书固定点概念的本地定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-godel-to-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-godel-to-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-godel-to-lob — Gödel Sentence is Löb Sentence of False"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地可证等价固定点；原书第 VIII–IX 章 pp.102–110 提供 Gödel/Henkin/Löb 与 HBL 背景；本地字符串和数码编码另行指定"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书固定点概念的本地定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (provability predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (the fixed contradiction sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\\)</span> (Löb-sentence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}to\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(\\gamma,\\bot_G)\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}to\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(\\gamma,\\bot_G)\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_G\">\\(\\varphi_G\\)</span> : Gödel固定点，满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi_G\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi_G\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\bot_G}\">\\(L_{\\bot_G}\\)</span> : 参数为固定矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>的Löb固定点</li>\n<li>关键观察：在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的经典逻辑中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>可证等价</li>\n<li>因此Gödel固定点满足参数为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>的Löb固定点方程</li>\n<li>这里断言同一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>满足两种固定点谓词；不同对角构造任选的见证未必字面相等，通常只能推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中的可证等价</li>\n<li>这揭示了两个定理的内在联系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-lob-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"71758b63b2ee2736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G$ (Gödel-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-godel-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bot_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (the fixed contradiction sentence, see [[92-df-contradiction]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-lob-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"71758b63b2ee2736","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LobSent}_G$ (Löb-sentence relation, see [[92-df-lob-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LobSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}to\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(\\gamma,\\bot_G)\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi_G\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\bot_G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2035,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-godel-to-lob]]"}],"outgoing":["b823f18a7fc28400","71758b63b2ee2736","e9cc91aaee998c7b","0dd7c9b3e61cc21b",